---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About RapRank" description="How RapRank finds, tests and ranks AI rap and music video tools.">
  <div class="prose-rr mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-4">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-white">About RapRank</h1>
    <p>RapRank is an independent directory of AI tools for making rap and music videos: video generators, rap song and beat generators, rapper voices and lyric writers.</p>
    <p>We check each tool's site, pricing page and free tier before listing it. Our rankings favor rap-specific features like fast lyric sync, lip-sync from a photo and rap styles, plus free plans that are actually usable.</p>
    <p>Some outbound links may be affiliate links. They never affect where a tool ranks.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
